Mythforge
=========

Mythforge is a self-hosted, AI-run tabletop RPG.

It is built on top of Odysseus, a third-party MIT-licensed self-hosted AI
workspace. The platform code Mythforge retains (routing, chat streaming, auth,
sessions, presets, model/endpoint management, image generation, galleries, and
supporting services) originates from Odysseus and remains under its MIT license.

  Odysseus — https://github.com/pewdiepie-archdaemon/odysseus
  Copyright (c) 2025 Odysseus Contributors
  MIT License (see LICENSE)

The game itself (the "Character Studio" / Mythforge layer — worlds, campaigns,
characters, the Game Master loop, dice and combat, pinpoint campaign memory) is
the contribution built on top of that platform.

Odysseus in turn adapts code from other open-source projects (opencode, llmfit,
Tongyi DeepResearch). Those attributions and their full license texts are kept
in ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md and licenses/. All are permissively licensed (MIT /
Apache-2.0); their copyright and license notices are preserved as required.

